{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Before long, the cliff along the stream came into view. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And there, faintly, the presence of people. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There seemed to be two or three of them.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
