{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE> was there too. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, what was it... the mood between them didn't seem good... 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It even looked like they were arguing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
