............!! 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> suddenly tried to jump off the cliff. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sight sent a chill through me, but <STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE> immediately held <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> down.<PG>
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Let go of me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Stop this foolishness!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shouts like that reached me. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two of them grappled on top of the cliff, and <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="は">crawled</STYLE> toward the edge. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> still seemed set on jumping off the cliff.<PG>
By rights, I should have gone out there and stopped <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> too. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at 10 years old, I couldn't even accept that <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> was trying to jump, and I just stood there, <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ぼうぜん">dazed</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even at a time like this, <STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE> slept on, so peacefully it was infuriating. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, precisely because it was a time like this, I wanted <STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE> to stay asleep.<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah...!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I suddenly let out a small scream. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
