<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n465\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the nick of time, <STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE> caught her by the wrist.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, let go! You'll fall too!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What good does </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> dying do!? Just climb up, now!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no way she could haul <STYLE ID="2">Mom's</STYLE> whole weight up with one arm. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> is going to... 
{PAUSE ""}
die.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-273\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-887\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
