{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\cannon1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "1000" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
The sound of <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> slamming into the ground, louder than I'd ever imagined, brought me back to myself.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">aaa!!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\林走る.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On reflex, I headed for the spot where <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> had fallen. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But to get down there, I had to go a long way around. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even on my legs, carrying <STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE>, it would take at least three minutes no matter how I hurried.<PG>
I held <STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE> tight in both arms so she wouldn't be jostled, and ran down the slope as fast as I could go. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just when my frenzy had finally gone away and I'd thought I could get back to my old life, this happened. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it have something to do with <STYLE ID="9">Auntie</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Haruka</STYLE> coming today? 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one had told me anything.<PG>
No, there were probably hardly any people who knew what was going on. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps the only one who knew was the one who'd been talking with <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> a moment ago: <STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\渓流.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
............? 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I saw a figure standing beside the stream and quickly ducked behind a tree. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> had to be somewhere around where that figure was standing. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But why? 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment I saw that person, I'd hidden without thinking. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something... 
{PAUSE ""}
Because it looked as if the figure was holding something, something strange. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I carefully peeked out to see what was going on.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ死体.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Right beside the stream, I saw <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, her arms and legs bent at wrong angles, blood splattered all around. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> lay perfectly still under the gaze of the person standing right beside her. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the person standing beside her was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎鉈2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE>, raising a nata high. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why... why is <STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE> here? 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is he raising a nata? 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait, wait...<PG>
That moment probably lasted only two or three seconds. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the air in that place froze, and it froze even time. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even my thinking froze, and I was made to watch that sight for a long, long time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "33" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\hit_axe1大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Space and time melted, and from the moment <STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE> brought the nata down until <STYLE ID="2">Mom's</STYLE> head went rolling, it was strangely fast. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It shattered my last hope, 'maybe she's still alive,' in an <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="せつな">instant</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\渓流.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then, footsteps behind me. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hid behind the tree again. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE> had come down too. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She passed right by me and stood before <STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
